      "message": "The way how we handle such cases is to copy the `intel_iommu_sm` value to a pKVM hypervisor\u0027s instance of the `intel_iommu_sm` variable during pKVM initialization in the host:\n```\npkvm_sym(intel_iommu_sm) \u003d intel_iommu_sm;\n```\n\nSee examples in setup_pkvm_syms() and pkvm_init_mmu().\n\nAnd then we can just use the `sm_supported()` helper as is in the pKVM hypervisor code, without the needed to define pKVM\u0027s version of it (and BTW without the need to modify the original code of those iommu_calculate_*agaw() functions).",
